RY.md` → memoria operativa inicial.\n4. `neodaemon/ARCHITECTURE.md`\n5. `neodaemon/OPERATING_PRINCIPLES.md`\n6. `protocols/confirmation-policy.md`\n7. `protocols/subagents.md`\n8. `subagents/TASK_VALIDATOR.md`\n9. `logs/decisions.md`\n\nSin tocar:\n\n- gateway\n- routing Telegram\n- ACP/acpx\n- modelos\n- sandbox global\n- Docker\n- sudo\n- internet\n- automatizaciones activas\n\nQueda como decisión registrada conceptualmente: **Neodaemon v2 entra en fase de bootstrap documental controlado**.","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_091df84b2f0fbfe5016a02ba9ca29c8191b9c540ca9e2b3c55\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.5","usage":{"input":2242,"output":292,"cacheRead":7680,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":10214,"cost":{"input":0.011210000000000001,"output":0.00876,"cacheRead":0.0038399999999999997,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02381}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1778563737614,"responseId":"resp_091df84b2f0fbfe5016a02ba9a124081919a2fd5ea85ecb8ce"}}
